WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.600
The whole console, in thirty seconds. It starts with one recording from one volunteer, and the two words anyone wrote about it.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:16.860
So we measure it. The observation page draws the evidence for a single pass. The live page does the same for any pass you name.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:26.240
Every pass is scored on what disagrees, and four hundred and seven go in order, so the fifty a reviewer can open are the fifty worth opening.

00:00:26.783 --> 00:00:37.663
Everything else is proof. Evaluation holds the gates, including the ones that did not pass. Agent is the same evidence reached by a model. Provenance says where every number came from.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:42.600
That is the map. nine pages, and every arrow ends at a receipt.
